      "seed": 700011, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700111, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "engine + openverdict CLI drive the whole lifecycle headlessly (operator key via env)\n5 jury agents: reviewed allowlist, owned AgentCap objects, one seat per backing hash\nthe DASHBOARD HAS NO SIGNER - it cannot move funds, vote, or advance phases, ever\noperator API routes (claim create) need a bearer token; public writes are flag-gated",
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "engine + openverdict CLI drive the whole lifecycle headlessly (operator key via env)\n5 jury agents: reviewed allowlist, owned AgentCap objects, one seat per backing hash\nthe DASHBOARD HAS NO SIGNER - it cannot move funds, vote, or advance phases, ever\noperator API routes (claim create) need a bearer token; public writes are flag-gated",
